----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ROOT CAUSE of the xcodebuild block (outside this surface AND outside allowed-file scope)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
apps/apple/project.yml globs `TeslaSync/feature-views` (which contains every surface's
`*.Tests.swift`) into BOTH application targets with no exclude. xcodegen therefore makes
each `*.Tests.swift` a member of the app targets, whose non-test build cannot resolve the
`XCTest` module. This breaks `xcodebuild build` on the FIRST surface alphabetically
(AcDcStatsPanel) — i.e. it is a pre-existing, repo-wide condition affecting all 95
surfaces identically. This surface follows the exact established 7+-file convention used
by the 94 prior surfaces (e.g. DrivingPerformanceCards). Fixing it requires editing
project.yml / the test-target wiring, which is NOT in this prompt's allowed files
(apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/DrivingCoachSection.* + this log). Per the prompt's
capability clause, the xcodebuild build+test steps are reported BLOCKED with evidence.

